{"id": 4402, "modified_gmt": "2026-11-16T17:18:08", "meta": {"_acf_changed": false, "footnotes": "", "_elementor_edit_mode": "builder", "_elementor_template_type": "wp-page", "_elementor_data": "[{\"id\": \"85874ad\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"settings\": {\"content_width\": \"full\", \"css_classes\": \"cc-wrap\", \"padding\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"top\": \"0\", \"right\": \"0\", \"bottom\": \"0\", \"left\": \"0\", \"isLinked\": true}, \"flex_gap\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"size\": 0, \"column\": \"0\", \"row\": \"0\"}}, \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"2ddc718\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"widgetType\": \"html\", \"settings\": {\"html\": \"<div class=\\\"cl cl-page\\\"><div class=\\\"hero phero\\\">\\n  <img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-hero-italian.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Maratona Dles Dolomites | View from Passo Gardena\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"in\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"crumbs\\\"><a href=\\\"/\\\">Home</a> / <a href=\\\"/trips/\\\">Bike tours</a> / Italian tours</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"pill-eyebrow\\\">2027 season \\u00b7 italy</div>\\n    <h1>ITALY BIKE TOURS</h1>\\n    <div class=\\\"bar\\\"></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"lede\\\"><p>Italy is the heartland of road cycling, and our guided bike tours take you through its most iconic terrain \\u2014 from the hairpin switchbacks of the Passo dello Stelvio to the white gravel roads of Chianti to the postcard peaks of the Dolomites and the blue water of Puglia. \\nRoutes are hand-built by our team of former pro riders, covering everything from the lakeside charm of Lake Garda &amp; Lake Como to the high-altitude legends of the Italian Alps.</p><p>Every holiday combines expertly planned routes with local culture, food, and hospitality, for riders of every level. Chase a Gran Fondo like Il Lombardia or Strade Bianche, tackle a multi-day climb, or just explore Italy bike tours at your own pace.</p></div>\\n    <p class=\\\"lede\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Can\\u2019t find the p