rducci, Tuscany, Italy</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-05-31\\\">31 May \\u2013 6 Jun 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">6 nights / 7 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>490 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>7,100 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i class=on></i><i class=on></i></span>Level: Expert</span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>When you think about Tuscany, as a cycling lover you immediately think about the white roads, cypress trees and rolling green hills.</p><p>Well, we have built a trip that goes around the whole region in order for to discover and immerse yourself in the Tuscany culture and gastronomy. All with your gravel bike, on 80% off roads. Simply a trip of a lifetime.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>Price</small>\\u20ac1399 | \\u00a31249 | $1649*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 31/12</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/tuscany-epic-gravel/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=5065115298&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n<article class=\\\"tcard\\\" data-k=\\\"gf\\\" data-level=\\\"beginner\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"ph\\\" href=\\\"