Enel, for the 40th edition on 4 July 2027.</p><p>Ride through the spectacular Dolomites, taking on iconic climbs including the Campolongo, Pordoi, Sella, Gardena, Giau and Falzarego, with premium accommodation and full support from our experienced team.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>From</small>\\u20ac2249 | \\u00a31959 | $2599*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 31/01</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/maratona-dles-dolomites/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=4934180003&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n<article class=\\\"tcard\\\" data-k=\\\"road\\\" data-level=\\\"intermediate\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"ph\\\" href=\\\"/trips/dolomites/\\\"><img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-dolomites.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Dolomites Tour\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"900\\\"><span class=\\\"tags\\\"><span class=\\\"tag\\\">Road</span></span><img class=\\\"flag\\\" src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-it.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Flag of Italy\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"30\\\"></a>\\n  <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n    <h2>Dolomites</h2>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"where\\\">Dolomites, Italy</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-07-08\\\">8\\u201313 Jul 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">5 nights/6 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>290 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>8,200 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i class=on></i><i></i></span>Level: Intermediate, Expert</span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>On this trip you will ride in one of the most spectacular places on Earth.</p><p>The Dolomites are so mystical and mind-blowing. Everywhere you look, it's a postcard. You will climb some of Italy's famous and beautiful climb: Giau, Gardena, Sella, Pordoi, Campolongo, Falzarego, Valparola, Fedaia, Tre Cime di Lavaredo and San Pellegrino.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>Price</small>\\u20ac1499 | \\u00a31349 | $1749*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 28/02</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/dolomites/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=9944206554&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n<article class=\\\"tcard\\\" data-k=\\\"road\\\" data-level=\\\"intermediate\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"ph\\\" href=\\\"/trips/italian-alps/\\\"><img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-italian-alps-1.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Italian Alps Tour\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"900\\\"><span class=\\\"tags\\\"><span class=\\\"tag\\\">Road</span></span><img class=\\\"flag\\\" src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-it.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Flag of Italy\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"30\\\"></a>\\n  <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n    <h2>Italian Alps</h2>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"where\\\">Bormio, Italy</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-07-15\\\">15\\u201320 Jul 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">5 nights/6 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>380 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>10,200 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i class=on></i><i></i></span>Level: Intermediate, Expert</span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>Take on an unforgettable cycling holiday in the Italian Alps, conquering some of the most legendary climbs in cycling history. Ride the iconic roads of the Giro d'Italia, including the Stelvio, Gavia, Mortirolo, Cancano and Foscagno. Each climb offers its own unique challenge, spectacular alpine scenery and an incredible sense of achievement, making this the ultimate trip for riders looking to experience Italy's most famous mountain passes.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>Price</small>\\u20ac1299 | \\u00a31149 | $1549*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 28/02</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/italian-alps/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=5899565803&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n<article class=\\\"tcard\\\" data-k=\\\"gravel\\\" data-level=\\\"expert\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"ph\\\" href=\\\"/trips/alpine-gravel-escape/\\\"><img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-alpine-gravel-escape.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Alpine Gravel Tour Bormio Cigala\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"900\\\"><span class=\\\"tags\\\"><span class=\\\"tag gravel\\\">Gravel</span></span><img class=\\\"flag\\\" src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-it.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Flag of Italy\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"30\\\"></a>\\n  <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n    <h2>Alpine Gravel Escape</h2>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"where\\\">Bormio, Italy</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-07-15\\\">15\\u201320 Jul 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">5 nights/6 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>320 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>9,300 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i class=on></i><i class=on></i></span>Level: Expert</span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>Experience the Italian Alps like never before. This unique gravel adventure takes you beyond the tarmac to ride the iconic Stelvio Gravel, spectacular alpine trails and historic military roads through breathtaking mountain landscapes. Designed for adventurous riders, it combines epic climbs, remote gravel routes and unforgettable scenery.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>Price</small>\\u20ac1299 | \\u00a31149 | $1549*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 28/02</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/alpine-gravel-escape/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=6681342030&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n<article class=\\\"tcard\\\" data-k=\\\"road\\\" data-level=\\\"beginner\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"ph\\\" href=\\\"/trips/lake-garda-and-stelvio/\\\"><img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-lake-garda-and-stelvio.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Lake Garda Bike Tour | Cigala Cycling\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"900\\\"><span class=\\\"tags\\\"><span class=\\\"tag\\\">Road</span></span><img class=\\\"flag\\\" src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-it.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Flag of Italy\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"30\\\"></a>\\n  <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n    <h2>Lake Garda &amp; Day Trip to Stelvio</h2>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"where\\\">Lake Garda, Italy</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-09-07\\\">7\\u201312 Sep 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">5 nights/6 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>460 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>4,000 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i></i><i></i></span>Level: Beginner, Intermediate, Expert</span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>One of our most popular trip.</p><p>Ride in the amazing routes around Lake Garda. Experience the amazing cuisine of the area and immerse yourself in the culture. Finally, on this trip you will have the opportunity to have a day trip and ride Italy's most famous climb: Passo Dello Stelvio!</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>Price</small>\\u20ac1099 | \\u00a3999 | $1299*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 30/04</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/lake-garda-and-stelvio/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=9061141280&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n<article class=\\\"tcard\\\" data-k=\\\"gravel\\\" data-level=\\\"intermediate\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"ph\\\" href=\\\"/trips/lake-garda-gravel/\\\"><img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-lake-garda-gravel.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Lake Garda Gravel bike tour\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"900\\\"><span class=\\\"tags\\\"><span class=\\\"tag gravel\\\">Gravel</span></span><img class=\\\"flag\\\" src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-it.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Flag of Italy\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"30\\\"></a>\\n  <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n    <h2>Lake Garda Gravel</h2>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"where\\\">Lake Garda, Italy</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-09-07\\\">7\\u201312 Sep 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">5 nights/6 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>340 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>3,500 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i class=on></i><i></i></span>Level: Intermediate, Expert</span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>Trade the tarmac for gravel on Lake Garda's quieter side.</p><p>Based in Moniga del Garda, explore the vineyard tracks of Valtenesi, the Moreniche hills, the Mincio Valley and the renowned Amarone wine region of Valpolicella. Six days of scenic gravel riding, historic villages and some of Italy's finest wine country.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>Price</small>\\u20ac1099 | \\u00a3999 | $1299*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 30/04</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/lake-garda-gravel/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=2303316283&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n<article class=\\\"tcard\\\" data-k=\\\"road\\\" data-level=\\\"beginner\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"ph\\\" href=\\\"/trips/italys-coast-to-coast/\\\"><img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-italys-coast-to-coast.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Italy&#x27;s Coast to Coast bike tour\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"900\\\"><span class=\\\"tags\\\"><span class=\\\"tag\\\">Road</span></span><img class=\\\"flag\\\" src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-it.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Flag of Italy\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"30\\\"></a>\\n  <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n    <h2>Italy's Coast to Coast</h2>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"where\\\">Tuscany, Umbria, Marche, Italy</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-09-24\\\">24 Sep \\u2013 1 Oct 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">7 nights/8 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>470 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>4,600 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i></i><i></i></span>Level: Beginner, Intermediate, Expert</span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>An incredible cycling experience, from coast to coast through the heart of Italy: this road bike tour will take you on unique ride, from the Tyrrhenian Sea to the Adriatic Sea.</p><p>You will be riding through the most amazing countryside: rolling hills, apennine mountains, hidden medieval villages surrounded by unspoiled nature.</p><p>Covering three regions in 6 riding days: Tuscany, Umbria &amp; Marche.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>Price</small>\\u20ac1649 | \\u00a31449 | $1899*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 30/05</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/italys-coast-to-coast/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=3772123174&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n<article class=\\\"tcard\\\" data-k=\\\"gf\\\" data-level=\\\"beginner\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"ph\\\" href=\\\"/trips/lake-como-gran-fondo-il-lombardia/\\\"><img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-lake-como-gran-fondo-il-lombardia.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Lake Como &amp; Lombardia 2027\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"900\\\"><span class=\\\"tags\\\"><span class=\\\"tag\\\">Road</span><span class=\\\"tag\\\">Gran Fondo</span></span><img class=\\\"flag\\\" src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-it.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Flag of Italy\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"30\\\"><span class=\\\"entry\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 3h10v2h4v3a5 5 0 0 1-4.6 5A5 5 0 0 1 13 15.9V19h4v2H7v-2h4v-3.1A5 5 0 0 1 7.6 13 5 5 0 0 1 3 8V5h4V3zm0 4H5v1a3 3 0 0 0 2 2.8V7zm10 0v3.8A3 3 0 0 0 19 8V7h-2z\\\"/></svg>Event entry guaranteed</span></a>\\n  <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n    <h2>Lake Como, Gran Fondo Il Lombardia &amp; Pro Race</h2>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"where\\\">Lake Como, Italy</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-10-06\\\">6\\u201311 Oct 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">5 nights/6 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>410 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>5,300 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i></i><i></i></span>Level: Beginner, Intermediate, Expert</span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>Everybody that is into cycling knows the last monument of the year, \\\"Il Lombardia\\\".</p><p>We designed a unique Cycling Holiday basing us on a central location for you to discover the beauty of Lake Como, watch the pros and ride the Gran Fondo \\\"Il Lombardia\\\".</p><p>From iconic climbs to lakeside roads, this is the ultimate way to experience Il Lombardia from the inside.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>Price</small>\\u20ac1299 | \\u00a31149 | $1499*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 30/05</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/lake-como-gran-fondo-il-lombardia/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=1699558775&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n    </div><p class=\\\"lvnone\\\" hidden>No tour here for this level yet. <a href=\\\"/trips/private-trips/\\\">Ask us for a custom tour</a> and we will plan one for you.</p>\\n    <p class=\\\"footnote\\\">*Prices in GBP or USD could be slightly different at the time of booking based on the current exchange rate. On our booking page you can choose your currency, see the live price in it and pay in the currency you prefer. By signing up to any of our Cycling Holidays (public or custom) you accept ou